msgstr "Funziona per alcune persone o solo a volte, non sempre"

#: includes/common/services/diagnostics/class-fix-catalog.php:264
msgid "We couldn't reach your site at all"
msgstr "Non siamo riusciti a raggiungere il tuo sito"

#: includes/common/services/diagnostics/class-fix-catalog.php:265
msgid "The site itself couldn't be reached, likely not AI-specific"
msgstr "Il sito stesso non era raggiungibile, probabilmente non è un problema legato all’IA"

#: includes/common/services/diagnostics/class-fix-catalog.php:272
msgid "Connected, but no abilities"
msgstr "Connesso, ma nessuna abilità"

#: includes/common/services/diagnostics/class-fix-catalog.php:273
msgid "The AI connects but lists no tools, or fewer than the dashboard shows"
msgstr "L’IA si connette ma non elenca strumenti, o ne elenca meno di quanti ne mostri la bacheca"

#: includes/common/services/diagnostics/class-fix-catalog.php:351
msgid "The rule is already in your .htaccess and the header still does not arrive. Something above WordPress (a host proxy or ModSecurity) is removing it, so only your host can fix this. Send them the copied diagnostics."
msgstr "La regola è già nel tuo .htaccess e l’header continua a non arrivare. Qualcosa a monte di WordPress (un proxy dell’hosting o ModSecurity) lo rimuove, quindi solo il tuo hosting può risolvere. Invia loro la diagnostica copiata."

#: includes/common/services/diagnostics/class-fix-catalog.php:353
msgid "Back up your .htaccess file, then add these two lines at the very top, above the \"# BEGIN WordPress\" block:"
msgstr "Fai un backup del file .htaccess, poi aggiungi queste due righe in cima, sopra il blocco \"# BEGIN WordPress\":"

#: includes/common/services/diagnostics/class-fix-catalog.php:354
msgid "If that does not resolve it, some hosts only accept this alternative:"
msgstr "Se il problema persiste, alcuni hosting accettano solo questa alternativa:"

#: includes/common/services/diagnostics/class-fix-catalog.php:360
msgid "This cannot be changed from WordPress or .htaccess on nginx. Add this inside the site's PHP location block, then reload nginx (on managed hosting, send it to your host):"
msgstr "Su nginx non si può modificare da WordPress o da .htaccess. Aggiungi questo nel blocco location PHP del sito, poi ricarica nginx (su un hosting gestito, invialo al tuo hosting):"

#: includes/common/services/diagnostics/class-fix-catalog.php:365
msgid "Only a change on the server itself fixes this, and this server type is not one we can edit for you. Ask your host to pass the Authorization header through to PHP and send them the copied diagnostics."
msgstr "Solo una modifica sul server stesso può risolvere, e questo tipo di server non è tra quelli che possiamo modificare per te. Chiedi al tuo hosting di far passare l’header Authorization fino a PHP e invia loro la diagnostica copiata."

#: includes/common/services/diagnostics/class-fix-catalog.php:369
msgid "Let the Authorization header reach WordPress"
msgstr "Fai arrivare l’header Authorization a WordPress"

#: includes/common/services/diagnostics/class-fix-catalog.php:370
msgid "Your server removes the sign-in headers before WordPress runs (common when PHP runs as CGI or FastCGI, such as cgi-fcgi). The gateway sends the token in two headers, Authorization and X-MO-Authorization, and both are being removed, so every request looks signed out."
msgstr "Il tuo server rimuove gli header di accesso prima che WordPress venga eseguito (succede spesso quando PHP gira come CGI o FastCGI, ad esempio cgi-fcgi). Il gateway invia il token in due header, Authorization e X-MO-Authorization, ed entrambi vengono rimossi, quindi ogni richiesta risulta non autenticata."

#: includes/common/services/diagnostics/class-fix-catalog.php:383
msgid "Stop Cloudflare challenging the connection"
msgstr "Evita che Cloudflare mostri una verifica alla connessione"

#: includes/common/services/diagnostics/class-fix-catalog.php:384
msgid "Cloudflare treats the AI gateway as a bot and answers with a challenge page instead of your site. A custom rule that skips bot checks for the MCP and OAuth paths fixes this."
msgstr "Cloudflare tratta il gateway IA come un bot e risponde con una pagina di verifica al posto del tuo sito. Una regola personalizzata che salta i controlli anti-bot per i percorsi MCP e OAuth risolve il problema."

#: includes/common/services/diagnostics/class-fix-catalog.php:386
msgid "In Cloudflare open Security, then WAF, then Custom rules, and create a rule. Choose \"Edit expression\" and paste:"
msgstr "In Cloudflare apri Security, poi WAF, poi Custom rules, e crea una regola. Scegli \"Edit expression\" e incolla:"

#: includes/common/services/diagnostics/class-fix-catalog.php:387
msgid "Set the action to Skip. Tick Super Bot Fight Mode rules (or Bot Fight Mode where offered) and Security Level."
msgstr "Imposta l’azione su Skip. Seleziona Super Bot Fight Mode rules (o Bot Fight Mode, se disponibile) e Security Level."

#: includes/common/services/diagnostics/class-fix-catalog.php:388
msgid "Save and drag the rule to the top of the list so it runs first."
msgstr "Salva e trascina la regola in cima all’elenco, così viene eseguita per prima."

#: includes/common/services/diagnostics/class-fix-catalog.php:389
msgid "On the Free plan Cloudflare may not let any rule skip Bot Fight Mode. If the challenge continues, turn Bot Fight Mode off under Security, then Bots, or allowlist the gateway IPs shown below."
msgstr "Con il piano Free, Cloudflare potrebbe non consentire a nessuna regola di saltare Bot Fight Mode. Se la verifica continua, disattiva Bot Fight Mode in Security, poi Bots, oppure aggiungi alla allowlist gli IP del gateway indicati sotto."

#: includes/common/services/diagnostics/class-fix-catalog.php:402
msgid "Check your firewall or security plugin's log for blocked requests to /wp-json/mosmcp/v1/mcp, /register or /token, and allow all three."
msgstr "Cerca nel log del firewall o del plugin di sicurezza le richieste bloccate verso /wp-json/mosmcp/v1/mcp, /register o /token, e consentile tutte e tre."

#: includes/common/services/diagnostics/class-fix-catalog.php:403
msgid "In your firewall, security plugin or host panel, exempt these paths from blocking and bot checks:"
msgstr "Nel firewall, nel plugin di sicurezza o nel pannello dell’hosting, escludi questi percorsi dai blocchi e dai controlli anti-bot:"

#: includes/common/services/diagnostics/class-fix-catalog.php:407
msgid "Open Tools, then Live Traffic, find the blocked requests to /wp-json/mosmcp/ and allowlist them."
msgstr "Apri Tools, poi Live Traffic, trova le richieste bloccate verso /wp-json/mosmcp/ e aggiungile alla allowlist."

#: includes/common/services/diagnostics/class-fix-catalog.php:408
msgid "Allowlist these paths in the firewall settings of the Sucuri dashboard."
msgstr "Aggiungi questi percorsi alla allowlist nelle impostazioni del firewall nella dashboard di Sucuri."

#: includes/common/services/diagnostics/class-fix-catalog.php:409
msgid "If the block page came from the host firewall, contact support with these paths and the gateway IPs."
msgstr "Se la pagina di blocco proviene dal firewall dell’hosting, contatta il supporto indicando questi percorsi e gli IP del gateway."

#: includes/common/services/diagnostics/class-fix-catalog.php:418
msgid "Only if you manage ModSecurity directly (VPS or dedicated hosting): this main-server-config rule turns it off for the MCP endpoint, as a temporary test to confirm the cause, not a permanent fix. Work with your host on a proper exception afterwards."
msgstr "Solo se gestisci direttamente ModSecurity (VPS o server dedicato): questa regola per la configurazione principale del server lo disattiva per l’endpoint MCP, come test temporaneo per confermare la causa, non come soluzione definitiva. In seguito concorda con il tuo hosting un’eccezione adeguata."

#: includes/common/services/diagnostics/class-fix-catalog.php:421
msgid "Run the connection test again."
msgstr "Esegui di nuovo il test di connessione."

#: includes/common/services/diagnostics/class-fix-catalog.php:424
msgid "Exempt the MCP URLs from your firewall"
msgstr "Escludi gli URL MCP dal firewall"

#: includes/common/services/diagnostics/class-fix-catalog.php:425
msgid "A firewall or security rule is blocking requests to the plugin before WordPress can answer them. AI clients then see an error or an empty list. If you are not on a self-managed server there is no universal snippet: it is a rule in that product or your host's panel."
msgstr "Una regola del firewall o di sicurezza blocca le richieste al plugin prima che WordPress possa rispondere. I client IA vedono quindi un errore o un elenco vuoto. Se non sei su un server autogestito non esiste uno snippet universale: si tratta di una regola in quel prodotto o nel pannello del tuo hosting."

#: includes/common/services/diagnostics/class-fix-catalog.php:440
msgid "Run the connection test: it lists the exact gateway IP addresses to allow. Allow them (not just skip logging) in every firewall or CDN in front of the site."
msgstr "Esegui il test di connessione: elenca gli indirizzi IP esatti del gateway da consentire. Consentili (non limitarti a escluderli dai log) in ogni firewall o CDN davanti al sito."

#: includes/common/services/diagnostics/class-fix-catalog.php:442
msgid "Allowlist these gateway IP addresses (allow, not just skip logging) in every firewall or CDN in front of the site:"
msgstr "Aggiungi alla allowlist questi indirizzi IP del gateway (consentili, non limitarti a escluderli dai log) in ogni firewall o CDN davanti al sito:"

#: includes/common/services/diagnostics/class-fix-catalog.php:446
msgid "Security, then WAF, then Tools, then IP Access Rules. Add each IP with the action Allow."
msgstr "Security, poi WAF, poi Tools, poi IP Access Rules. Aggiungi ogni IP con l’azione Allow."

#: includes/common/services/diagnostics/class-fix-catalog.php:449
msgid "Add each IP under Firewall, then All Firewall Options, in the allowlisted IPs list."
msgstr "Aggiungi ogni IP in Firewall, poi All Firewall Options, nell’elenco degli IP in allowlist."

#: includes/common/services/diagnostics/class-fix-catalog.php:451
msgid "On shared hosting, send the list to your host and ask them to allowlist it in their firewall."
msgstr "Su un hosting condiviso, invia l’elenco al tuo hosting e chiedi di aggiungerlo alla allowlist del suo firewall."

#: includes/common/services/diagnostics/class-fix-catalog.php:451
msgctxt "hosting provider, as a platform tab label"
msgid "Host"
msgstr "Hosting"

#: includes/common/services/diagnostics/class-fix-catalog.php:454
msgid "Allowlist the gateway IP addresses"
msgstr "Aggiungi alla allowlist gli indirizzi IP del gateway"

#: includes/common/services/diagnostics/class-fix-catalog.php:455
msgid "Your site accepts some gateway addresses and rejects others. Allowlisting all of them removes the random failures."
msgstr "Il tuo sito accetta alcuni indirizzi del gateway e ne rifiuta altri. Aggiungerli tutti alla allowlist elimina gli errori casuali."

#: includes/common/services/diagnostics/class-fix-catalog.php:467
msgid "Allow the plugin through your REST API restriction"
msgstr "Fai passare il plugin attraverso la restrizione della REST API"

#: includes/common/services/diagnostics/class-fix-catalog.php:468
msgid "WordPress or a security plugin only lets logged-in users use the REST API, so the AI client is turned away before it can sign in."
msgstr "WordPress o un plugin di sicurezza consente l’uso della REST API solo agli utenti connessi, quindi il client IA viene respinto prima di poter accedere."

#: includes/common/services/diagnostics/class-fix-catalog.php:470
msgid "In the plugin that restricts the REST API (for example a \"disable REST API\" option in a security plugin), add this namespace to its allowlist:"
msgstr "Nel plugin che limita la REST API (ad esempio un’opzione \"disable REST API\" in un plugin di sicurezza), aggiungi questo namespace alla sua allowlist:"

#: includes/common/services/diagnostics/class-fix-catalog.php:471
msgid "Or turn the restriction off for unauthenticated requests, then run the connection test again."
msgstr "Oppure disattiva la restrizione per le richieste non autenticate, poi esegui di nuovo il test di connessione."

#: includes/common/services/diagnostics/class-fix-catalog.php:486
msgid "LiteSpeed Cache: open Cache, then Excludes, and add this under Do Not Cache URIs:"
msgstr "LiteSpeed Cache: apri Cache, poi Excludes, e aggiungi questo in Do Not Cache URIs:"

#: includes/common/services/diagnostics/class-fix-catalog.php:489
msgid "Cloudflare: add a Cache Rule that bypasses the cache when the URI path starts with:"
msgstr "Cloudflare: aggiungi una Cache Rule che ignora la cache quando il percorso URI inizia con:"

#: includes/common/services/diagnostics/class-fix-catalog.php:492
msgid "In your cache plugin or CDN, exclude this path from caching and from any redirect rule:"
msgstr "Nel plugin di cache o nella CDN, escludi questo percorso dalla cache e da qualsiasi regola di reindirizzamento:"

#: includes/common/services/diagnostics/class-fix-catalog.php:492
msgid "Other cache or CDN"
msgstr "Altra cache o CDN"

#: includes/common/services/diagnostics/class-fix-catalog.php:494
msgid "Purge the whole cache, then run the connection test again."
msgstr "Svuota tutta la cache, poi esegui di nuovo il test di connessione."

#: includes/common/services/diagnostics/class-fix-catalog.php:497
msgid "Stop caching the plugin's API"
msgstr "Non mettere in cache l’API del plugin"

#: includes/common/services/diagnostics/class-fix-catalog.php:498
msgid "A cache or redirect rule answers requests to the plugin with a stored web page, so the gateway never reaches WordPress."
msgstr "Una regola di cache o di reindirizzamento risponde alle richieste al plugin con una pagina web salvata, quindi il gateway non raggiunge mai WordPress."

#: includes/common/services/diagnostics/class-fix-catalog.php:510
msgid "Remove the password prompt in front of the site"
msgstr "Rimuovi la richiesta di password davanti al sito"

#: includes/common/services/diagnostics/class-fix-catalog.php:511
msgid "The site asks for a username and password (HTTP Basic authentication) before WordPress runs, and an AI client cannot answer it."
msgstr "Il sito chiede nome utente e password (autenticazione HTTP Basic) prima che WordPress venga eseguito, e un client IA non può rispondere."

#: includes/common/services/diagnostics/class-fix-catalog.php:513
msgid "Remove the password protection from the site, or exempt these paths from it (host panel \"Password protected directories\", or .htpasswd rules):"
msgstr "Rimuovi la protezione con password dal sito, oppure escludi da essa questi percorsi (\"Password protected directories\" nel pannello dell’hosting, o regole .htpasswd):"

#: includes/common/services/diagnostics/class-fix-catalog.php:525
msgid "Fix the server error on the site"
msgstr "Correggi l’errore del server sul sito"

#: includes/common/services/diagnostics/class-fix-catalog.php:526
msgid "The site answered with a 5xx error, so the problem is on the server or in a plugin, not in the AI client."
msgstr "Il sito ha risposto con un errore 5xx, quindi il problema è sul server o in un plugin, non nel client IA."

#: includes/common/services/diagnostics/class-fix-catalog.php:528
msgid "Check the PHP error log or turn on WP_DEBUG_LOG in wp-config.php and look for a fatal error when this test runs."
msgstr "Controlla il log degli errori PHP oppure attiva WP_DEBUG_LOG in wp-config.php e cerca un errore fatale durante l’esecuzione di questo test."

#: includes/common/services/diagnostics/class-fix-catalog.php:529
msgid "Make sure the site is not in maintenance mode and the host is not overloaded."
msgstr "Assicurati che il sito non sia in modalità manutenzione e che l’hosting non sia sovraccarico."

#: includes/common/services/diagnostics/class-fix-catalog.php:541
msgid "Make the site reachable"
msgstr "Rendi raggiungibile il sito"

#: includes/common/services/diagnostics/class-fix-catalog.php:542
msgid "The request never got an answer from the site, so this is not specific to AI connections."
msgstr "La richiesta non ha mai ricevuto risposta dal sito, quindi il problema non riguarda solo le connessioni IA."

#: includes/common/services/diagnostics/class-fix-catalog.php:544
msgid "Open your site address in a private browser window over https and confirm it loads."
msgstr "Apri l’indirizzo del sito in https in una finestra di navigazione privata e verifica che si carichi."

#: includes/common/services/diagnostics/class-fix-catalog.php:545
msgid "Check your DNS records point at the right server and that the host or a firewall is not dropping requests that come from data centers."
msgstr "Controlla che i record DNS puntino al server giusto e che l’hosting o un firewall non scartino le richieste provenienti dai data center."

#: includes/common/services/diagnostics/class-fix-catalog.php:546
msgid "If the site is slow, a timeout can happen under load. Run the test again in a minute."
msgstr "Se il sito è lento, sotto carico può verificarsi un timeout. Riprova il test tra un minuto."

#: includes/common/services/diagnostics/class-fix-catalog.php:558
msgid "Fix the HTTPS certificate"
msgstr "Correggi il certificato HTTPS"

#: includes/common/services/diagnostics/class-fix-catalog.php:559
msgid "AI clients refuse a site whose certificate is expired, does not cover the address, or is missing its chain."
msgstr "I client IA rifiutano un sito il cui certificato è scaduto, non copre l’indirizzo o non ha la catena completa."

#: includes/common/services/diagnostics/class-fix-catalog.php:561
msgid "Renew or reissue the certificate so it covers both the bare domain and the www host, and install the full chain."
msgstr "Rinnova o riemetti il certificato in modo che copra sia il dominio senza www sia l’host www, e installa la catena completa."

#: includes/common/services/diagnostics/class-fix-catalog.php:562
msgid "Most hosts renew automatically under SSL or Security in their panel. Run the connection test again after renewing."
msgstr "La maggior parte degli hosting lo rinnova automaticamente nella sezione SSL o Sicurezza del pannello. Dopo il rinnovo esegui di nuovo il test di connessione."

#: includes/common/services/diagnostics/class-fix-catalog.php:576
msgid "These addresses answered but do not serve this site. Delete the A or AAAA records that point at them:"
msgstr "Questi indirizzi hanno risposto ma non servono questo sito. Elimina i record A o AAAA che puntano a essi:"

#: includes/common/services/diagnostics/class-fix-catalog.php:578
msgid "Delete any A or AAAA record that points at a server which does not host this site."
msgstr "Elimina qualsiasi record A o AAAA che punta a un server che non ospita questo sito."

#: includes/common/services/diagnostics/class-fix-catalog.php:580
msgid "Wait for DNS to refresh (often under an hour), then run the connection test again."
msgstr "Attendi l’aggiornamento dei DNS (spesso meno di un’ora), poi esegui di nuovo il test di connessione."

#: includes/common/services/diagnostics/class-fix-catalog.php:583
msgid "Remove DNS records that point at the wrong server"
msgstr "Rimuovi i record DNS che puntano al server sbagliato"

#: includes/common/services/diagnostics/class-fix-catalog.php:584
msgid "Your domain resolves to more than one address and some of them are not your site, so connections succeed for some clients and fail at random for others."
msgstr "Il tuo dominio si risolve in più indirizzi e alcuni non sono il tuo sito, quindi le connessioni riescono per alcuni client e falliscono a caso per altri."

#: includes/common/services/diagnostics/class-fix-catalog.php:596
msgid "Repair the plugin database tables"
msgstr "Ripara le tabelle del database del plugin"

#: includes/common/services/diagnostics/class-fix-catalog.php:597
msgid "The plugin could not create or upgrade its tables, so agents, tokens and permissions cannot be saved."
msgstr "Il plugin non è riuscito a creare o aggiornare le sue tabelle, quindi agenti, token e permessi non possono essere salvati."

#: includes/common/services/diagnostics/class-fix-catalog.php:599
msgid "Deactivate the plugin and activate it again on the Plugins page. This re-runs the install step."
msgstr "Disattiva il plugin e attivalo di nuovo nella pagina Plugin. In questo modo viene rieseguita l’installazione."

#: includes/common/services/diagnostics/class-fix-catalog.php:600
msgid "If the tables are still missing, the database user probably cannot create or alter tables. Ask your host to grant CREATE and ALTER to the WordPress database user."
msgstr "Se le tabelle mancano ancora, probabilmente l’utente del database non può creare o modificare tabelle. Chiedi al tuo hosting di concedere i privilegi CREATE e ALTER all’utente del database di WordPress."

#: includes/common/services/diagnostics/class-fix-catalog.php:612
msgid "Create and enable an agent"
msgstr "Crea e abilita un agente"

#: includes/common/services/diagnostics/class-fix-catalog.php:613
msgid "An agent decides which abilities AI clients may use. With no enabled agent every client is refused."
msgstr "Un agente decide quali abilità possono usare i client IA. Senza un agente abilitato, ogni client viene rifiutato."

#: includes/common/services/diagnostics/class-fix-catalog.php:615
msgid "Open the Agents page, create an agent and make sure it is enabled."
msgstr "Apri la pagina Agenti IA, crea un agente e assicurati che sia abilitato."

#: includes/common/services/diagnostics/class-fix-catalog.php:627
msgid "Grant abilities to a role"
msgstr "Concedi abilità a un ruolo"

#: includes/common/services/diagnostics/class-fix-catalog.php:628
msgid "Abilities are granted per role inside an agent. A role with no grants sees an empty list."
msgstr "Le abilità si concedono per ruolo all’interno di un agente. Un ruolo senza autorizzazioni vede un elenco vuoto."

#: includes/common/services/diagnostics/class-fix-catalog.php:630
msgid "Open the Agents page, edit the agent, pick the role of the person who will connect, and tick the abilities to allow. Save."
msgstr "Apri la pagina Agenti IA, modifica l’agente, scegli il ruolo della persona che si connetterà e seleziona le abilità da consentire. Salva."

#: includes/common/services/diagnostics/class-fix-catalog.php:631
msgid "Make sure the agent is enabled, then run the connection test again."
msgstr "Assicurati che l’agente sia abilitato, poi esegui di nuovo il test di connessione."

#: includes/common/services/diagnostics/class-fix-catalog.php:643
msgid "Make WordPress abilities available"
msgstr "Rendi disponibili le abilità di WordPress"

#: includes/common/services/diagnostics/class-fix-catalog.php:644
msgid "WordPress reports no registered abilities, so there is nothing to give AI clients."
msgstr "WordPress non segnala abilità registrate, quindi non c’è nulla da fornire ai client IA."

#: includes/common/services/diagnostics/class-fix-catalog.php:646
msgid "Update WordPress to the version this plugin requires, and make sure no plugin unregisters abilities."
msgstr "Aggiorna WordPress alla versione richiesta da questo plugin e assicurati che nessun plugin annulli la registrazione delle abilità."

#: includes/common/services/diagnostics/class-fix-catalog.php:658
msgid "Make the gateway see the same abilities as the dashboard"
msgstr "Fai vedere al gateway le stesse abilità della bacheca"

#: includes/common/services/diagnostics/class-fix-catalog.php:659
msgid "The gateway and this dashboard disagree on how many abilities exist. The usual causes are a stale cache or a connection signed in as a different role."
msgstr "Il gateway e questa bacheca non concordano sul numero di abilità esistenti. Le cause più comuni sono una cache non aggiornata o una connessione autenticata con un ruolo diverso."

#: includes/common/services/diagnostics/class-fix-catalog.php:661
msgid "Wait a minute (the gateway caches the list briefly), then run the test again."
msgstr "Attendi un minuto (il gateway mette brevemente in cache l’elenco), poi esegui di nuovo il test."

#: includes/common/services/diagnostics/class-fix-catalog.php:662
msgid "Disconnect and reconnect the connector in the AI app so it fetches a fresh list."
msgstr "Disconnetti e riconnetti il connettore nell’app di IA, così recupera un elenco aggiornato."

#: includes/common/services/diagnostics/class-fix-catalog.php:663
msgid "Check that the connecting WordPress user has the role you granted abilities to, and that no MOSMCP_EXPOSED_PREFIXES constant in wp-config.php trims the list."
msgstr "Controlla che l’utente WordPress che si connette abbia il ruolo a cui hai concesso le abilità e che nessuna costante MOSMCP_EXPOSED_PREFIXES in wp-config.php riduca l’elenco."

#: includes/common/services/diagnostics/class-fix-catalog.php:675
msgid "Use one public https address for the site"
msgstr "Usa un unico indirizzo https pubblico per il sito"

#: includes/common/services/diagnostics/class-fix-catalog.php:676
msgid "AI clients need a single public https address. Plain http, mixed www and non-www hosts, a private address, or a proxy that makes WordPress think it is on http all make sign-in fail, or make every request come back unauthorized after connecting."
msgstr "I client IA hanno bisogno di un unico indirizzo https pubblico. Il semplice http, host con e senza www mescolati, un indirizzo privato o un proxy che fa credere a WordPress di essere in http fanno fallire l’accesso, oppure fanno risultare non autorizzata ogni richiesta dopo la connessione."

#: includes/common/services/diagnostics/class-fix-catalog.php:678
msgid "In Settings, then General, set WordPress Address and Site Address to the same public https address, with one canonical host (all www or all non-www)."
msgstr "In Impostazioni, poi Generali, imposta Indirizzo WordPress e Indirizzo sito sullo stesso indirizzo https pubblico, con un unico host canonico (tutto www o tutto senza www)."

#: includes/common/services/diagnostics/class-fix-catalog.php:679
msgid "Redirect the other host to it, but never for /wp-json/: the gateway does not follow redirects there, and a redirected POST loses its body and sign-in header. A local address such as localhost cannot be reached from outside your computer."
msgstr "Reindirizza l’altro host su questo, ma mai per /wp-json/: lì il gateway non segue i reindirizzamenti, e una POST reindirizzata perde il corpo e l’header di accesso. Un indirizzo locale come localhost non è raggiungibile dall’esterno del tuo computer."

#: includes/common/services/diagnostics/class-fix-catalog.php:680
msgid "If HTTPS ends at a proxy or load balancer, add this near the top of wp-config.php so WordPress knows it is on https:"
msgstr "Se l’HTTPS termina su un proxy o un load balancer, aggiungi questo verso l’inizio di wp-config.php così WordPress sa di essere in https:"

#: includes/common/services/diagnostics/class-fix-catalog.php:692
msgid "Reconnect the AI client"
msgstr "Riconnetti il client IA"

#: includes/common/services/diagnostics/class-fix-catalog.php:693
msgid "The saved sign-in for this client is expired, rejected or never finished, so it cannot refresh itself."
msgstr "L’accesso salvato per questo client è scaduto, rifiutato o mai completato, quindi non può rinnovarsi da solo."

#: includes/common/services/diagnostics/class-fix-catalog.php:695
msgid "In the AI app (Claude, ChatGPT), remove the connector and add it again to sign in fresh."
msgstr "Nell’app di IA (Claude, ChatGPT), rimuovi il connettore e aggiungilo di nuovo per accedere da capo."

#: includes/common/services/diagnostics/class-fix-catalog.php:707
msgid "Let this server reach the miniOrange gateway"
msgstr "Consenti a questo server di raggiungere il gateway miniOrange"

#: includes/common/services/diagnostics/class-fix-catalog.php:708
msgid "The test from outside runs on the miniOrange gateway, and this server could not reach it. Either the gateway is briefly unavailable or outgoing HTTPS is blocked."
msgstr "Il test dall’esterno viene eseguito sul gateway miniOrange e questo server non è riuscito a raggiungerlo. Il gateway è temporaneamente non disponibile oppure l’HTTPS in uscita è bloccato."

#: includes/common/services/diagnostics/class-fix-catalog.php:710
msgid "Allow outgoing HTTPS from this server to this host in your firewall or host panel:"
msgstr "Consenti l’HTTPS in uscita da questo server verso questo host nel firewall o nel pannello dell’hosting:"

#: includes/common/services/diagnostics/class-fix-catalog.php:711
msgid "Try again in a few minutes in case it was a brief outage."
msgstr "Riprova tra qualche minuto, nel caso si sia trattato di un’interruzione temporanea."

#: includes/common/services/diagnostics/class-fix-catalog.php:723
msgid "Send the diagnostics to support"
msgstr "Invia la diagnostica al supporto"

#: includes/common/services/diagnostics/class-fix-catalog.php:724
msgid "This result does not match a known cause, so we need the details to find it."
msgstr "Questo risultato non corrisponde a una causa nota, quindi ci servono i dettagli per individuarla."

#: includes/common/services/diagnostics/class-gateway-result-evaluator.php:98
msgid "This client registered but never finished signing in."
msgstr "Questo client si è registrato ma non ha mai completato l’accesso."

#: includes/common/services/diagnostics/class-gateway-result-evaluator.php:101
msgid "The refresh token expired, so this client must reconnect."
msgstr "Il refresh token è scaduto, quindi questo client deve riconnettersi."

#. translators: %s: how long ago the token was last refreshed.
#: includes/common/services/diagnostics/class-gateway-result-evaluator.php:107
#, php-format
msgid "Last refreshed %s and the refresh token expires within 2 days."
msgstr "Ultimo rinnovo %s; il refresh token scade entro 2 giorni."

#. translators: %s: how long ago the token was last refreshed.
#: includes/common/services/diagnostics/class-gateway-result-evaluator.php:111
#, php-format
msgid "Last refreshed %s."
msgstr "Ultimo rinnovo %s."

#. translators: %d: minutes.
#: includes/common/services/diagnostics/class-gateway-result-evaluator.php:125
#, php-format
msgid "%d min ago"
msgstr "%d min fa"

#. translators: %d: hours.
#: includes/common/services/diagnostics/class-gateway-result-evaluator.php:129
#, php-format
msgid "%d h ago"
msgstr "%d h fa"

#. translators: %d: days.
#: includes/common/services/diagnostics/class-gateway-result-evaluator.php:133
#, php-format
msgid "%d d ago"
msgstr "%d g fa"

#: includes/common/services/diagnostics/class-gateway-result-evaluator.php:162
#: includes/common/services/diagnostics/class-response-classifier.php:223
msgid "Skipped: the MCP endpoint could not be reached."
msgstr "Saltato: impossibile raggiungere l’endpoint MCP."

#: includes/common/services/diagnostics/class-gateway-result-evaluator.php:190
msgid "Passed from the gateway."
msgstr "Superato dal gateway."

#: includes/common/services/diagnostics/class-gateway-result-evaluator.php:196
msgid "The gateway could not finish this check because of an unexpected error on its side, so there is no result for your site. Run the test again; if it keeps happening, contact support."
msgstr "Il gateway non ha potuto completare questo controllo a causa di un errore imprevisto dalla sua parte, quindi non c’è un risultato per il tuo sito. Esegui di nuovo il test; se continua a succedere, contatta il supporto."

#: includes/common/services/diagnostics/class-gateway-result-evaluator.php:207
#: includes/common/services/diagnostics/class-response-classifier.php:283
msgid "The plugin did not report whether the Authorization header arrived (a proxy may be stripping response headers)."
msgstr "Il plugin non ha indicato se l’header Authorization è arrivato (un proxy potrebbe rimuovere gli header della risposta)."

#: includes/common/services/diagnostics/class-gateway-result-evaluator.php:209
#: includes/common/services/diagnostics/class-response-classifier.php:280
msgid "The server removed both sign-in headers (Authorization and the gateway's backup header) before WordPress saw them, so every request looks signed out."
msgstr "Il server ha rimosso entrambi gli header di accesso (Authorization e l’header di riserva del gateway) prima che WordPress li ricevesse, quindi ogni richiesta risulta non autenticata."

#: includes/common/services/diagnostics/class-gateway-result-evaluator.php:212
msgid "The site advertises addresses (http or another host) that differ from the one the gateway used, so tokens are rejected after connecting."
msgstr "Il sito dichiara indirizzi (http o un altro host) diversi da quello usato dal gateway, quindi i token vengono rifiutati dopo la connessione."

#: includes/common/services/diagnostics/class-gateway-result-evaluator.php:223
msgid "The gateway refuses to call this address because it is private or does not resolve publicly."
msgstr "Il gateway si rifiuta di chiamare questo indirizzo perché è privato o non si risolve pubblicamente."

#. translators: %d: HTTP status.
#: includes/common/services/diagnostics/class-gateway-result-evaluator.php:227
#, php-format
msgid "The gateway got an unexpected response (HTTP %d)."
msgstr "Il gateway ha ricevuto una risposta imprevista (HTTP %d)."

#: includes/common/services/diagnostics/class-gateway-result-evaluator.php:294
msgid "DNS records the gateway resolved"
msgstr "Record DNS risolti dal gateway"

#: includes/common/services/diagnostics/class-gateway-result-evaluator.php:297
#: includes/common/services/diagnostics/class-response-classifier.php:366
msgid "The address could not be resolved (DNS)."
msgstr "Impossibile risolvere l’indirizzo (DNS)."

#. translators: %s: comma-separated IP addresses.
#: includes/common/services/diagnostics/class-gateway-result-evaluator.php:313
#, php-format
msgid "DNS points at addresses that do not serve this site: %s. Clients that pick one of them fail at random."
msgstr "Il DNS punta a indirizzi che non servono questo sito: %s. I client che ne scelgono uno falliscono a caso."

#. translators: %d: number of A/AAAA records.
#: includes/common/services/diagnostics/class-gateway-result-evaluator.php:318
#, php-format
msgid "%d address records, all serving the site."
msgstr "%d record di indirizzo, tutti servono il sito."

#. translators: %s: gateway IP address.
#: includes/common/services/diagnostics/class-gateway-result-evaluator.php:363
#, php-format
msgid "Gateway IP %s"
msgstr "IP del gateway %s"

#: includes/common/services/diagnostics/class-gateway-result-evaluator.php:364
msgid "Gateway (default route)"
msgstr "Gateway (instradamento predefinito)"

#: includes/common/services/diagnostics/class-gateway-result-evaluator.php:368
msgid "This IP was not probed individually. Allowlist it anyway."
msgstr "Questo IP non è stato verificato singolarmente. Aggiungilo comunque alla allowlist."

#. translators: %s: cause of the block.
#: includes/common/services/diagnostics/class-gateway-result-evaluator.php:397
#, php-format
msgid "Requests from this gateway IP are blocked while other gateway IPs get through. %s"
msgstr "Le richieste da questo IP del gateway vengono bloccate, mentre altri IP del gateway passano. %s"

#: includes/common/services/diagnostics/class-gateway-result-evaluator.php:402
msgid "This gateway IP had no network route to the site, so it could not be tested."
msgstr "Questo IP del gateway non aveva un percorso di rete verso il sito, quindi non è stato possibile testarlo."

#: includes/common/services/diagnostics/class-gateway-result-evaluator.php:404
msgid "The site answered this gateway IP."
msgstr "Il sito ha risposto a questo IP del gateway."

#: includes/common/services/diagnostics/class-gateway-result-evaluator.php:462
msgid "This address answered, but not with this site."
msgstr "Questo indirizzo ha risposto, ma non con questo sito."

#: includes/common/services/diagnostics/class-gateway-result-evaluator.php:473
msgid "Abilities the gateway discovers"
msgstr "Abilità rilevate dal gateway"

#: includes/common/services/diagnostics/class-gateway-result-evaluator.php:477
